# Update Progress Skill

Use after completing, pausing or blocking work. Append (newest on top) to
`docs/develop/AGENT_PROGRESS.md`:

```md
## <YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm> — Sprint <n>, Batch <n>

Status: DONE | IN_PROGRESS | BLOCKED | PAUSED

Completed:
- ...

Files changed:
- ...

Verification:
- (one entry per command in {{VERIFY_SEQUENCE}}): pass / fail / not run

Blockers:
- ...

Next:
- ...
```

Rules:
- Do not exaggerate progress.
- Do not mark incomplete work as DONE.
- Record blockers concretely (what is missing, smallest decision needed).
